1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,110
Paid a scammer in

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,150
gift cards?

3
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,150
Don't throw the card

4
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:03,890
away.

5
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:04,907
If you paid with

6
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:06,087
a gift card,

7
00:00:06,357 --> 00:00:07,167
contact the company that

8
00:00:07,117 --> 00:00:08,267
issued the card,

9
00:00:08,217 --> 00:00:09,127
using the number on

10
00:00:09,077 --> 00:00:09,927
the back.

11
00:00:09,957 --> 00:00:11,107
Tell them a scammer

12
00:00:11,057 --> 00:00:12,087
tricked you into giving

13
00:00:12,037 --> 00:00:12,927
up the card number

14
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:14,207
and PIN, and ask

15
00:00:14,157 --> 00:00:15,347
for a refund.

16
00:00:15,477 --> 00:00:16,587
Keep the card and

17
00:00:16,537 --> 00:00:17,767
keep the receipt.

